# {{senseid|en|Q80042}} {{lb|en|UK|Commonwealth|Ireland}} A written [[order]] directing a [[bank]] to pay money to a [[person]] or [[entity]]. {{C|en|Banking}}
#: {{alti|en|check<id:Q80042><qq:US>}}
